message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CedarKit"
abstract:
  CedarKit is a toolkit supporting Convergent Cross Mapping (CCM) and
  Empirical Dynamic Modeling (EDM) analysis, built on top of pyEDM. It
  handles project configuration, running and organizing CCM computations,
  post-processing outputs (aggregating skill-vs-library-size curves,
  finding candidate lag peaks, selecting target lags), and visualizing
  results, with support for both local and HPC workflows.
